      "text": "\nIf value in response is\ndifferent than value requested\nchange widget value to value\nin response\n\nIf status is failure change the\nwidget value to previous value \n\nUnlock event queue\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "xtBpOZ-uEgC3N-l8hNX96",
      "originalText": "\nIf value in response is different than value requested  change widget value to value in response\n\nIf status is failure change the widget value to previous value \n\nUnlock event queue\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
